  "profile": {
    "storyTitle": "Profile",
    "text": "Catherine is a Victorian workers' representative. During the Londinium incident, she joined the Citizens' Self-Salvation Corps and worked in concert with Rhodes Island.\nWith her facilitation, several factories and workers' organizations reached agreements with us to tackle issues such as Originium cleanup, infection prevention, and medical care."
